{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the master of the house shall be brought near.</b> For an oath, as it is written, 'if he did not stretch out his hand against the property of.' But one may not say, 'and he shall be brought near' for judgment — how would you interpret 'and he shall be brought near for judgment if he did not stretch out his hand,' but if he did stretch out his hand, he shall not do judgment? All the more so he needs to do judgment." "<b>In the property of his fellow.</b> An expression of acquisition and property, like לרגל המלאכה."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:59:42.793873112Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}